flowchart LR
  subgraph Clients[Client Apps]
    WEB[Web · React + TS + Vite]
    UI[Desktop UI · React + TS]
    TAURI[Tauri v2 · Rust commands]
    UI -->|invoke| TAURI
  end
  subgraph Edge[Edge & Identity]
    IDP[OIDC Identity Provider]
    GW[Axum API Gateway / BFF]
  end
  WEB -->|HTTPS cookie| GW
  TAURI -->|HTTPS access token| GW
  WEB -.->|login| IDP
  TAURI -.->|system browser + PKCE| IDP
  subgraph RustServices[Rust Axum + Tokio + SQLx]
    CUSTOMER[Customer]
    CATALOG[Catalog]
    PRICING[Pricing + Promotion]
    INV[Inventory]
    CART[Cart]
    ORDER[Order + Checkout]
    PAY[Payment]
    FULFILL[Fulfillment]
  end
  GW --> CUSTOMER & CATALOG & PRICING & INV & CART & ORDER & PAY & FULFILL
  RustServices -->|owned data only| DBS[(8 PostgreSQL databases)]
  ORDER -->|transactional outbox| MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
  MQ -.-> FULFILL
  GW --> REDIS[(Redis)]
